</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Out of my shameful failure and loss,</l><l>Jesus, I come! Jesus, I come!</l><l>Into the glorious gain of Thy cross,</l><l>Jesus, I come to Thee!</l><l>Out of earth’s sorrows into Thy balm,</l><l>Out of life’s storm and into Thy calm,</l><l>Out of distress to jubilant psalm,</l><l>Jesus, I come to Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Out of unrest and arrogant pride,</l><l>Jesus, I come! Jesus, I come!</l><l>Into Thy blessed will to abide,</l><l>Jesus, I come to Thee!</l><l>Out of myself to dwell in Thy love,</l><l>Out of despair into raptures above,</l><l>Upward for aye on wings like a dove,</l><l>Jesus, I come to Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Out of the fear and dread of the tomb,</l><l>Jesus, I come! Jesus, I come!</l><l>Into the joy and pleasure, Thine own,</l><l>Jesus, I come to Thee!</l><l>Out of the depths of ruin untold,</l><l>Into the flock Thy love doth enfold,</l><l>Ever Thy glorious face to behold,</l><l>Jesus, I come to Thee!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
